WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:04.113
Unit seven. Using a Trackpad!

2
00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:09.927
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:13.523
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:17.481
Today we learn about Using a Trackpad. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:22.700
Trackpad. Say it with me. Trackpad!

6
00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:29.628
Click. Say it with me. Click!

7
00:00:33.138 --> 00:00:36.829
Scroll. Say it with me. Scroll!

8
00:00:40.405 --> 00:00:44.096
Cursor. Say it with me. Cursor!

9
00:00:47.508 --> 00:00:50.863
Tap. Say it with me. Tap!

10
00:00:54.402 --> 00:00:58.000
Swipe. Say it with me. Swipe!

11
00:01:01.498 --> 00:01:05.154
Pointer. Say it with me. Pointer!

12
00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.318
Move. Say it with me. Move!

13
00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:24.346
A trackpad lets me move the cursor on the screen. I tap to click and swipe to scroll. The pointer moves where I touch.

14
00:01:24.396 --> 00:01:27.906
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:28.669 --> 00:01:34.403
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.453 --> 00:01:35.603
Scroll!

17
00:01:36.558 --> 00:01:42.132
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.182 --> 00:01:43.332
Pointer!

19
00:01:44.415 --> 00:01:51.857
Did you know? A trackpad can sense your finger through a technology similar to what touchscreens use!

20
00:01:51.907 --> 00:01:54.352
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.271 --> 00:02:03.742
Think and answer. How is a trackpad different from a mouse?

22
00:02:03.792 --> 00:02:04.942
Great answer!

23
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:11.765
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:14.925
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

